GCC
===

C compiler - turns code into program.


BASIC
-----
gcc program.c

Compiles to a.out


CUSTOM NAME
-----------
gcc program.c -o myprogram

Creates "myprogram" instead.


MULTIPLE FILES
---------------
gcc main.c helper.c -o program

Compiles multiple files together.


FLAGS
-----
-Wall               Show all warnings
-Wextra             Extra warnings
-O2                 Optimize code
-g                  Debug info


COMMON
------
gcc -Wall -Wextra program.c -o prog

Compile with warnings.


ERRORS VS WARNINGS
------------------
Error    = Won't compile
Warning  = Compiles but might be wrong


DEBUG
-----
gcc -g program.c -o prog
gdb prog           Debug with GDB


TIPS
----
Always compile with -Wall
Fix warnings before submitting.
Warnings save you from bugs.
